  "description": "<p>While you can't create a new resource on top of a tombstone, you can create a resource as a child of it.</p>\n\n<p>Example</p>\n\n<p>&gt; curl -i -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box</a> <br/>\nHTTP/1.1 410 Gone<br/>\nDate: Fri, 06 Nov 2020 21:00:20 GMT<br/>\nSet-Cookie: JSESSIONID=node018i1ge7u1mdut1seew79r98hxf4.node0; Path=/<br/>\nExpires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT<br/>\nSet-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Thu, 05-Nov-2020 21:00:20 GMT<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box/fcr:tombstone\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box/fcr:tombstone</a>&gt;; rel=\"hasTombstone\"<br/>\nContent-Type: text/plain<br/>\nContent-Length: 79<br/>\nServer: Jetty(9.4.24.v20191120)</p>\n\n<p>Discovered tombstone resource at /box, departed at: 2020-11-06T19:15:16.005957Z</p>\n\n<p>curl -i -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPUT <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box/bin/bag\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box/bin/bag</a><br/>\nHTTP/1.1 201 Created<br/>\nDate: Fri, 06 Nov 2020 20:59:31 GMT<br/>\nSet-Cookie: JSESSIONID=node0yniz4zmksrrytlefbvetjk560.node0; Path=/<br/>\nExpires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT<br/>\nSet-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Thu, 05-Nov-2020 20:59:31 GMT<br/>\nETag: W/\"272D4DB3AB01A3871F8B624ACD783581\"<br/>\nX-State-Token: 272D4DB3AB01A3871F8B624ACD783581<br/>\nLast-Modified: Fri, 06 Nov 2020 20:59:31 GMT<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box/bin/bag\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box/bin/bag</a>&gt;; rel=\"timegate\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box/bin/bag\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box/bin/bag</a>&gt;; rel=\"original\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box/bin/bag/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box/bin/bag/fcr:versions</a>&gt;; rel=\"timemap\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Resource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeGate\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeGate</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#RDFSource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#RDFSource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Container\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Container</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Container\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Container</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"<br/>\nLink: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box/bin/bag/fcr:acl\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/box/bin/bag/fcr:acl</a>&gt;; rel=\"acl\"<br/>\nLocation: <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/box/bin/bag\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://l